WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,680
Didn’t you eat today?

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:06,080
And you ate both mine and your grandma’s share.

3
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:10,130
You losers deserve to eat your mother

4
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:12,330
Don't get together with these two losers.

5
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:14,530
A damn old thing

6
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:16,690
Someone who can't even do base missions

7
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:17,690
Legless waste

8
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,090
It's just a drag, right, right, right

9
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:21,290
My son is right

10
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:22,890
The two of us are alone

11
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,690
Take these two useless sons apart

12
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:26,290
I'm your dad

13
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:28,970
I carried you all the way out

14
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,770
I'll take care of you until your body recovers.

15
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:34,170
You can't stop losing daddy as soon as you're well, baby

16
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,460
I'm your grandma

17
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:36,860
It's me who hurts you from beginning to end

18
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:39,460
What's on your list is none of your business.

19
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,730
If it weren't for your incompetence

20
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,330
How can I live such a miserable life?

21
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,530
Could it be that money can’t even buy a house?

22
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:46,930
I made my wife beat me too much
